{
 "_about": "Shared fixtures for skills/build-item/scripts/item-status.py decide. Each case's request is merged over `workspace` (a case's own workspace keys replace the base's). `expect` is the answer minus `message`; an `errors` case must exit 2 with one item-status: line. Tooling that re-implements the rule should run these against itself.",
